      en: ["The present stone church was completed in the year 1820.", "Latvian leader Kārlis Ulmanis was baptized here in September 1877.", "The altar painting titled 'Golgotha' dates from the mid-19th century.", "It replaced an earlier wooden church building constructed in 1690.", "The building sustained minor damage during the independence battles of 1919.", "The church's pipe organ was built by the Sauer company in 1863."],
